  data: {
    LLM: '1. **Drawing**: Each turn, draw either the top card of the stock or the top discard. 2. **Melding**: Form sets (3-4 cards same rank) and runs (3+ consecutive same suit). 3. **Initial Meld**: Must meet round-specific point requirements. 4. **Discarding**: End turn by discarding one card.',
    Player: '1. **Drawing**: Each turn, draw either the top card of the stock or the top discard. 2. **Melding**: Form sets (3-4 cards same rank) and runs (3+ consecutive same suit). 3. **Initial Meld**: Must meet round-specific point requirements. 4. **Discarding**: End turn by discarding one card.',
    objective: "Be the first to 'Go Out' by melding all cards. The player with the lowest score after 7 rounds is the champion.",
